1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
[narrator] Three days remain
until the sorting.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
In the palace,
the King has completed his recovery

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
and plays Gungi without rest.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
That's checkmate.

5
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

6
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
[singer singing in English]

7
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

8
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,000
[singer singing in English]

9
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

10
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:06,000
GUNGI X OF X KOMUGI

11
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:17,000
-We will resume in half a day.
-Huh?

12
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,000
But I can keep playing if you want me to.

13
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:24,000
I would take no joy in defeating you
while you're in this weakened state.

14
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,000
Go recover your strength.

15
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,000
This woman is a liability.

16
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:54,000
If this continues,
she will certainly cause problems.

17
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,000
[Komugi groans softly]

18
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:12,000
Well, if there's nothing else,
then I'll be going now.

19
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:31,000
So he could defeat the Gungi champion
at her peak.

20
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,000
So he could demonstrate his prowess.

21
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,000
as someone whom the King
was never able to best.

22
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,000
I'm such a fool!

23
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,000
I almost let a thoughtless impulse

24
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:04,000
leave a hideous,
irreparable scar on the King!

25
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,000
What was I thinking?

26
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:21,000
I shall pay for this with my life

27
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:25,000
once I ensure that the King
will rule the world.

28
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,000
[wailing]

29
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:33,000
Hmm?

30
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,000
[Knuckle] Seven people
will infiltrate the palace

31
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Ikalgo, and finally Morel.

32
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,000
A few seconds after us,

33
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:51,000
the Chairman will enter
from outside Pitou's En.

34
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,000
During that time,

35
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:57,000
we all need to try to lure the Royal Guard
as far from the King as we can.

36
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:00,000
First up, Ikalgo, Killua, and Gon.

37
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:04,000
When we suddenly appear
in the middle of the palace,

38
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:13,000
They'll be in a tight formation.

39
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:16,000
Breaking it won't be easy.

40
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:20,000
Hmm, and that's where I come into play.

41
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,000
[grunts]

42
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,000
[imperceptible]

43
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:42,000
Okay. You got any questions?

44
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:45,000
[Gon] Uh, so about Palm…

45
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:11,000
I'm almost certain that she would take it
as an insult to her resolve.

46
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:14,000
-[sighs]
-[Knuckle] Hey, take it easy, will you?

47
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,000
Gon's just concerned about her is all.

48
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,000
And that would make us just like moths

49
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:35,000
flying straight into the heart
of a burning flame.

50
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:37,000
We would be dead on arrival.

51
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:41,000
But instead of worrying about
a bunch of worst-case scenarios,

52
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,000
let's trust Palm
to do whatever she has to.

53
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:46,000
All that makes sense if you ask me,

54
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:51,000
but I think what Gon is trying to say here
is that if Palm really has met such a fate

55
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:53,000
we still have time to change the plan.

56
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:24,000
it might cause the entire operation
to completely fall apart.

57
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:28,000
We still have two days,
plenty of time for Palm to contact us.

58
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:39,000
Meow-kay. Understood.

59
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:49,000
[King] Should I have tried
to escape to the right, perhaps?

60
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,000
[Komugi] You should've moved your knight.

61
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:54,000
You see,
I didn't want to let a single piece

62
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:56,000
control the center of the board.

63
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:06,000
you won't ever be able
to make me hesitate.

64
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:10,000
[sighs] Being passive is foreign to me.

65
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,000
-[Shaiapouf] Sire.
-What do you want?

66
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:20,000
[Shaiapouf] I have intel
for your ears only.

67
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,000
[gasps]

68
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,000
[King] It's fine. Speak.

69
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:28,000
Two days remain until the national rally.

70
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:31,000
The number of citizens
to process in the capital

71
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:41,000
Your point? I suggest you get to it.

72
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,000
[Shaiapouf] Very well, sire.

73
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:47,000
I would like to move up
the post-sorting schedule.

74
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:50,000
[King] That's all? Do as you wish.

75
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:09,000
[Menthuthuyoupi chuckles]
So you were chased out too.

76
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:14,000
We just need to wait for the King to win
and it'll be fine.

77
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,000
-[Shaiapouf] No.
-What?

78
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:23,000
A minute ago, you said you did.
What changed your mind?

79
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:26,000
The King is improving
at a remarkable rate,

80
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,000
but she is evolving as well.

81
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:34,000
So I'm no longer able to predict
the outcome of this contest.

82
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:55,000
[Neferpitou] I'm 100% sure
he's acting completely alone…

83
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:59,000
the man who defeated Leol.

84
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,000
Reports from Welfin and the others

85
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:06,000
confirm that the soldiers he controls
are all smoke puppets.

86
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:10,000
They don't move like Nen puppets,

87
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:27,000
Unfortunately, I can't leave my post yet.

88
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:31,000
Maybe he'll come to me. [groans]

89
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:40,000
[Knuckle] It's just about time
for us to enter the capital.

90
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:43,000
The enemy should have noticed
Morel's distraction by now

91
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:53,000
At the same time we're doing that,

92
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:03,000
then everyone'll think assassins
are hidden somewhere among the citizens,

93
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:07,000
[King] She attacks where I'm weak
without hesitation.

94
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:10,000
She's getting even sharper as we play.

95
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:14,000
Two-one-one, cavalry.

96
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:19,000
Okay, six-six-one, captain.

97
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:21,000
[King] But it's not suffocating.

98
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:25,000
In fact, I find this enjoyable,

99
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:28,000
because she's guiding me
into that style of play.

100
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:34,000
But that only goes to show
that she is still far above me in skill.

101
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:42,000
Dear leader, I feel…

102
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:46,000
I feel weird.

103
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:56,000
It just isn't stopping.

104
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,000
No matter what I do,

105
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:03,000
all these wonderful moves
keep flooding into my head.

106
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:07,000
If I try,
I'm sure that I can become even better.

107
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,000
[King] She's awakened?

108
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,000
That can only mean…

109
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,000
She's about to get stronger.

110
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,000
That's checkmate.

111
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,000
Is there something wrong?

112
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:39,000
No. I'd like to go back
to my room for a bit

113
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:47,000
around the game board. That's all.

114
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:50,000
When I touch the pieces
after they're placed,

115
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:53,000
I never forget their position.
It just stays in my head.

116
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,000
[King] Every move she's ever played?

117
00:13:57,000 --> 00:14:00,000
-Fine. You're excused.
-[Komugi] Thank you.

118
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,000
[King] A foolish question.

119
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,000
Her name.

120
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,000
Hey.

121
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:13,000
Your name? What should I call you by?

122
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,000
[Komugi] You mean me, sire?

123
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:18,000
[King] Is there anyone else here?

124
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:21,000
Um, my name is Komugi, dear leader!

125
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,000
Komugi, huh?

126
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:25,000
Hmm.

127
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,000
[Komugi] Dear leader,

128
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:30,000
if it isn't too forward of me to ask,

129
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:33,000
I wonder if you'd mind
telling me your name.

130
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,000
[King gasps]

131
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:38,000
My name?

132
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:41,000
What?

133
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:45,000
What is it?

134
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:55,000
Sire. I am at your service.

135
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:58,000
-Pouf.
-Yes.

136
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,000
-[King] Youpi.
-Yes, sire.

137
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,000
Is anything the matter, sire?

138
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:08,000
-[King] Pouf.
-Wha…

139
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:10,000
That's right. You are known as Pouf.

140
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:17,000
Hmm, so then tell me, what is my name?

141
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:41,000
and then the entire world will know that
there is but one true and rightful king.

142
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:45,000
[King] That assumes
the others can be eliminated.

143
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:53,000
Your thoughts, Youpi?

144
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:56,000
Your question is far beyond my capacity,

145
00:15:56,000 --> 00:16:00,000
so as much as I'd love to answer it, sire,
I don't know.

146
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:02,000
-[King] Pitou?
-Hmm.

147
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:05,000
I'm sure that
whatever your feelings are in the matter,

148
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:06,000
they greatly outweigh my own.

149
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,000
If I could make a suggestion,

150
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:12,000
perhaps you should select the name that
you find the most pleasing to your ear.

151
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,000
Hmm. Very well, then.

152
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:17,000
[eagle screeches]

153
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:20,000
[Shaiapouf] You can choose a name
after the sorting is complete.

154
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:25,000
For the time being, our top priority
is to finish all the preparations

155
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,000
Mmm.

156
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:32,000
Is something wrong, sire?

157
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:51,000
[Shaiapouf] He bothered to learn her name?

158
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:54,000
[King] She has awakened.

159
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:57,000
Komugi will now become much stronger,

160
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,000
-Pitou.
-Yes.

161
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:05,000
If Komugi were to endure the sorting,

162
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:08,000
the same kind as what will occur tomorrow,

163
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,000
what would happen to her?

164
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:11,000
She would die, sire.

165
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:41,000
…I ended a child's life.

166
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:44,000
[Shaiapouf] Sire, you mustn't say it!

167
00:17:45,000 --> 00:17:47,000
[King] It's possible that the child…

168
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:49,000
[Shaiapouf] Please,
this isn't becoming of you.

169
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:53,000
[King] …possessed the raw potential
to surpass me in a particular field.

170
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:55,000
[Shaiapouf] The king must be absolute.

171
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:57,000
[King] Yet I extinguished it.

172
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:59,000
[Shaiapouf] Do not repent your actions.

173
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:03,000
I had no real reason, not a single one.

174
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:06,000
[Shaiapouf] That's enough, sire.
You mustn't say any more!

175
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,000
[Shaiapouf gasps]

176
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:17,000
[eagle screeches]

177
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:22,000
-[King laughing]
-[gasps]

178
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,000
[laughs]

179
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:35,000
So that must mean
that I have tremendous power.

180
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:37,000
I appear without warning

181
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:40,000
to rob countless beings
of their inferior strength.

182
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:44,000
To crush, to destroy.

183
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:47,000
Violence is my power,

184
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,000
[Neferpitou] Why?

185
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:07,000
[Shaiapouf] I jumped
to the wrong conclusion

186
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:10,000
and came within a hair's breadth
of insulting the King.

187
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:15,000
I foolishly believed
that His Highness regretted his actions,

188
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:36,000
If the girl impedes the King,
then we've got no choice but to kill her.

189
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:41,000
[shudders] To think that my mind works
on the exact same level as yours.

190
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:03,000
Komugi, that female is no different.

191
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:07,000
Her skill is in Gungi,
a simple board game.

192
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:16,000
So her life is subject to my whim.

193
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:20,000
If I but change my mind,
I can crush her immediately.

194
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:29,000
The goal was simply to kill time
before the selection,

195
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,000
She's worthless to me.

196
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:39,000
Let's kill her right now.

197
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:58,000
[King] Why didn't you call for help?

198
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:02,000
Look here and here.
There's blood all over you!

199
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:16,000
People might still be sleeping,
and I didn't want to bother them.

200
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:20,000
But you wouldn't have bothered
anyone at all.

201
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:22,000
What?

202
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:25,000
You are a guest of the King.

203
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:27,000
What am I saying?

204
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:31,000
I came here to kill her, didn't I?

205
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:57,000
[King] What is this creature?

206
00:21:59,000 --> 00:22:00,000
And me…

207
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:03,000
What do I want to do with her?

208
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:05,000
[sobbing continues]

209
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:07,000
[closing theme music playing]

210
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:11,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

211
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:29,000
[upbeat music playing]

212
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:41,000
[Killua] Then we're all set
for future preview segments.
